Package: bande-os-apple
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: bande-desktop, linux-image-apple-arm64-16k (= @VERSION@)
Recommends: bande-scripts, bande-usb-gadget, bande-nvram, bande-bless, bande-avd-firmware, bande-avd-gstreamer
Description: Bande for the Mac mini M2
 Bande on Apple Silicon: the Bande desktop and system on Debian testing, with
 Debian's kernel built with the Bande Apple patches (the apple-arm64-16k
 flavour). Debian's own kernels can't run this hardware, so this package keeps
 them from being installed.
